{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06306","headline":"古意二首 二 · 祖咏","name":"古意二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚王竟何去，独自留巫山。\n偏使世人见，迢迢江汉间。\n驻舟春谿里，誓愿拜灵颜。\n梦寐覩神女，金沙鸣佩环。\n闲艳绝世姿，令人气力微。\n含笑默不语，化作朝云飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}